{"seq":3,"slug":"media-cost-format-metric","title":"媒体成本与质量指标监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/media-asset-processing-service/cdn-delivery-ops/media-cost-format-metric","wordCount":2676,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"媒体成本与质量指标监控\">媒体成本与质量指标监控</h1><p>前面十一篇做的所有取舍——用哪档质量参数、切几档码率、产出多少变体、缓存多久——都建立在同一个前提上：<strong>这些取舍的效果可以被测量</strong>。如果测不出来，&quot;画质降 5% 换体积降 30%&quot; 就只是一句会议上的直觉；而如果测错了，团队会朝着错误的方向连续优化几个季度。这篇要给出的是可测量的定义，以及把它们放进同一张报表的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>媒体管道有四类成本，它们的量纲不同，必须分别度量再合成：</p>\n<p><strong>存储成本</strong>由对象的总字节数乘以单位价格决定，且与存储类别和时间强相关。它的驱动因素是&quot;变体数量 × 单变体体积 × 保留时长&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>处理成本</strong>由 CPU/GPU 时间决定。它的驱动因素是&quot;任务数 × 单任务算力 × 重试次数&quot;，其中重试次数容易被低估——一个 5% 的重试率意味着 5% 的额外算力，但它往往还伴随着次生成本（中间产物重复读写）。</p>\n<p><strong>分发成本</strong>由出网字节数决定。它的驱动因素是&quot;请求数 × 平均响应体积 ÷ 缓存命中带来的节省倍率&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>质量损失</strong>是唯一的非货币成本，必须用一个可比较的量表达。这正是 VMAF 存在的理由——它是 Netflix 提出的&quot;基于多方法融合的感知视频质量评估算法&quot;，其 <code>libvmaf</code> 实现同时内置 PSNR、PSNR-HVS、SSIM、MS-SSIM 与 CIEDE2000（<a href=\"https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf\">VMAF 项目</a>）。</p>\n<p>四类成本的关系不是加和而是<strong>权衡</strong>：任何一类都可以通过牺牲另一类来降低。因此监控的目标不是&quot;让每个指标都变小&quot;，而是<strong>让权衡关系可见且可回归</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ING[媒体入库] --&gt; MP[处理成本&lt;br/&gt;CPU 时间 × 任务数 × 重试]&#10;    ING --&gt; MS[存储成本&lt;br/&gt;字节 × 类别 × 时长]&#10;    MP --&gt; OUT[产物集合]&#10;    OUT --&gt; MC[分发成本&lt;br/&gt;出网字节 ÷ 命中节省]&#10;    OUT --&gt; MQ[质量度量&lt;br/&gt;VMAF/SSIM 对源]&#10;    MP --&gt; DASH[单资产成本看板]&#10;    MS --&gt; DASH&#10;    MC --&gt; DASH&#10;    MQ --&gt; DASH&#10;    DASH --&gt; DEC{决策}&#10;    DEC --&gt;|质量降幅 &lt; 阈值 且成本降幅 &gt; 阈值| SHIP[采纳]&#10;    DEC --&gt;|质量降幅超阈值| REJECT[回滚参数]&#10;    SHIP --&gt; BASE[更新基线 进入回归门]&#10;    REJECT --&gt; BASE\">graph TD\n    ING[媒体入库] --&gt; MP[处理成本&lt;br/&gt;CPU 时间 × 任务数 × 重试]\n    ING --&gt; MS[存储成本&lt;br/&gt;字节 × 类别 × 时长]\n    MP --&gt; OUT[产物集合]\n    OUT --&gt; MC[分发成本&lt;br/&gt;出网字节 ÷ 命中节省]\n    OUT --&gt; MQ[质量度量&lt;br/&gt;VMAF/SSIM 对源]\n    MP --&gt; DASH[单资产成本看板]\n    MS --&gt; DASH\n    MC --&gt; DASH\n    MQ --&gt; DASH\n    DASH --&gt; DEC{决策}\n    DEC --&gt;|质量降幅 &lt; 阈值 且成本降幅 &gt; 阈值| SHIP[采纳]\n    DEC --&gt;|质量降幅超阈值| REJECT[回滚参数]\n    SHIP --&gt; BASE[更新基线 进入回归门]\n    REJECT --&gt; BASE</pre><h2 id=\"单位成本的三个定义式\">单位成本的三个定义式</h2><p>把成本除到&quot;每个资产&quot;&quot;每个请求&quot;&quot;每个有效像素&quot;上，才能跨时间与跨业务比较。三个最有用的定义式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"单资产处理成本\">单资产处理成本</h3><p>一个资产从入库到全部变体产出所消耗的算力时间，单位可以是 CPU·秒。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{proc} = \\frac{\\sum_{tasks} t_{cpu} \\times (1 + r_{retry})}{N_{assets}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sse</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{retry}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重试放大系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应包含解码、变换、编码三段。这个指标最直接的用途是发现&quot;某些资产特别贵&quot;——例如超大尺寸的原图或超长视频，它们往往只占 1% 的数量却占 20% 的成本，适合单独设限或走异步慢通道。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单请求分发成本\">单请求分发成本</h3><p>出网字节除以请求数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{deliver} = \\frac{\\sum B_{egress}}{N_{requests}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个量下降通常意味着缓存命中率或格式压缩生效；它上升则可能是缓存策略被破坏（例如 Vary 配置错误导致命中率骤降，见 <a href=\"responsive-srcset-serving\">多端响应式分发（srcset/Accept）</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单位像素质量效率\">单位像素质量效率</h3><p>质量得分与字节数的比值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>VMAF</mtext><mrow><mtext>bytes</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{\\text{VMAF}}{\\text{bytes} / 10^6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bytes</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VMAF</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个量用于<strong>跨编码器与跨参数比较</strong>。同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 下字节更少者胜；同一个字节下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 更高者胜。它也是&quot;该不该上 AVIF&quot;这类问题的判定依据——不是&quot;AVIF 更好&quot;，而是&quot;在可接受的质量阈值下，AVIF 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是否显著高于 WebP&quot;。</p>\n<p>三个定义式的共同点是<strong>分母都选了一个业务上可解释的单位</strong>（资产、请求、兆字节），而不是技术单位（CPU 核数、连接数）。这是让报表能被非工程角色读懂的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"必须采集的四组信号\">必须采集的四组信号</h2><p>指标体系的最小完备集是四组，缺任何一组都会让某类问题不可见。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组别</th>\n<th>关键信号</th>\n<th>采集点</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>处理</td>\n<td>任务数、成功率、重试率、P50/P99 耗时、队列等待时长</td>\n<td>任务状态表 + 计时埋点</td>\n<td>只看平均耗时，掩盖长尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>对象数、总字节、按前缀分布、生命周期转换与过期计数</td>\n<td>对象存储清单 + 规则命中日志</td>\n<td>忘记统计未完成分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分发</td>\n<td>请求数、命中率、出网字节、按格式/尺寸分桶的占比</td>\n<td>CDN 访问日志</td>\n<td>只用总体命中率，看不到按格式的分化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>抽样资产的 VMAF/SSIM、感知指纹命中率、失败样本清单</td>\n<td>转码后抽样任务</td>\n<td>只在调参时抽一次，没有连续基线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"处理组-重试率是先行指标\">处理组：重试率是先行指标</h3><p>重试率上升通常早于成功率下降——它是下游开始不稳定的最早信号。把它做成分包维度的曲线（按编码器、按源格式、按租户），能定位到具体环节。<strong>只监控总体重试率会掩盖&quot;某个编码器全挂在重试&quot;这类局部故障</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"存储组-按前缀分布是成本归因的载体\">存储组：按前缀分布是成本归因的载体</h3><p>对象存储的总字节数本身没有行动价值，<strong>按前缀的分布才有</strong>。因为生命周期规则按前缀作用（见 <a href=\"../3-processing-pipeline/object-storage-key-lifecycle\">对象存储键设计与生命周期</a>），而且最容易被漏掉的是&quot;未完成的分片上传&quot;——它们不出现在正常的对象列举里。文档明确指出，若不做中止，这些分片会持续占用存储并计费；这正是为什么&quot;生命周期配置&quot;里必须有 abort 规则的确切理由。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分发组-命中率必须按内容类别分开看\">分发组：命中率必须按内容类别分开看</h3><p>整体命中率是一个容易被拉高的坏指标：不可变变体（<code>immutable</code>、一年有效期）几乎 100% 命中，会把可重写清单与私有内容的高未命中率淹没。因此<strong>至少按&quot;不可变变体 / 可重写清单 / 私有内容&quot;三分组分桶统计</strong>，并对后两组的未命中率单独设阈值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量组-基线必须连续-而不是一次性\">质量组：基线必须连续，而不是一次性</h3><p>质量监控最容易被做成&quot;调参时跑一次批量对比&quot;，之后再不运行。这样做的后果是：上游换了源素材特征（例如商家开始大量上传 HDR 图）、或编码器升级了小版本，质量漂移完全不可见。正确做法是<strong>固定抽样比例</strong>（例如每千个资产抽一个）、<strong>固定度量与固定参照源</strong>，让曲线连续可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量回退门与参数变更流程\">质量回退门与参数变更流程</h2><p>指标体系的最终用途是让参数变更可以安全落地。一个可复用的流程是四步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>离线回测</strong>：在固定语料上扫参数网格，产出&quot;参数 → 字节数 × 质量得分&quot;表；</li>\n<li><strong>候选选择</strong>：在满足质量阈值的前提下选最小字节的方案；</li>\n<li><strong>灰度</strong>：对新参数只应用于一小部分资产，同时保留旧参数产物用于对照；</li>\n<li><strong>回退门</strong>：连续观测窗口内若抽样质量得分低于基线超过阈值，自动回退到旧参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 3 步之所以要求&quot;保留旧参数产物&quot;，是因为质量对比必须<strong>在同一资产上做</strong>——跨资产对比会被语料差异淹没。这也要求版本化键机制（见 <a href=\"cdn-invalidation-version\">CDN 刷新与媒体版本化</a>）支持同一资产的多版本并存，而这恰好是内容寻址键天然提供的性质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"失败样本必须被留档\">失败样本必须被留档</h3><p>聚合指标会掩盖个体失败。一个资产质量得分极低，在均值里可能被完全冲掉，但它恰恰是最有诊断价值的样本。因此质量监控必须同时产出<strong>低分样本清单</strong>与<strong>失败样本清单</strong>，并保留到可复查（通常按 <a href=\"cdn-invalidation-version\">隐私与保留策略</a> 的私有内容规则处理，不进公开报表）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE media_quality_sample (&#10;  sample_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  asset_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  variant_key   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  version       TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  pipeline_ver  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  metric        TEXT        NOT NULL,   -- &#39;vmaf&#39; | &#39;ssim&#39; | &#39;psnr&#39;&#10;  score         NUMERIC(6,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  bytes         INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  sampled_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON media_quality_sample (pipeline_ver, variant_key, sampled_at);&#10;&#10;-- 按管道版本对比同一变体的质量与体积趋势（回归门的数据源）&#10;SELECT pipeline_ver,&#10;       variant_key,&#10;       count(*)              AS n,&#10;       avg(score)            AS avg_score,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.05) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY score) AS p05_score,&#10;       avg(bytes)            AS avg_bytes&#10;FROM media_quality_sample&#10;WHERE sampled_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY pipeline_ver, variant_key&#10;ORDER BY variant_key, pipeline_ver;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> media_quality_sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variant_key   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pipeline_ver  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metric        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'vmaf' | 'ssim' | 'psnr'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bytes         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampled_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> media_quality_sample (pipeline_ver, variant_key, sampled_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按管道版本对比同一变体的质量与体积趋势（回归门的数据源）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipeline_ver,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       variant_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score)            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p05_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes)            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> media_quality_sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipeline_ver, variant_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> variant_key, pipeline_ver;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里用的是 <code>p05_score</code>（第 5 百分位）而不是最低分：最低分对单个异常样本过敏，而 P05 能稳定地反映&quot;最差的那 5% 有多差&quot;——这正是用户投诉的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报表的组织方式\">报表的组织方式</h2><p>最后一步是把四组指标合成一张可决策的报表。有效的组织方式是<strong>按决策问题的维度切分</strong>，而不是按数据来源切分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三张切片\">三张切片</h3><ul>\n<li>按<strong>资产类型</strong>（图片/视频/短视频）：回答&quot;该优化哪条管道&quot;；</li>\n<li>按<strong>终端档位</strong>（低档/中档/高档变体）：回答&quot;哪一档的性价比最差&quot;；</li>\n<li>按<strong>管道版本</strong>（<code>pipeline_ver</code>）：回答&quot;这次改参是赚了还是亏了&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"底表的四列\">底表的四列</h3><p>三张切片共用的底表应当包含：单资产处理成本、单资产存储字节、该资产的出网字节、以及抽样质量得分。有了这四列，绝大多数取舍都可以在一张表里回答。若底表按资产类型聚合，还可以直接产出&quot;每 GB 出网对应的处理成本&quot;这类交叉比率，用于发现&quot;已经很少被访问、却仍在为每次访问付出高处理成本&quot;的长尾资产。</p>\n<h3 id=\"把权衡写成一句话\">把权衡写成一句话</h3><p>一个有用的收尾做法是<strong>为每个资产类型定义一个&quot;成本—质量基线&quot;</strong>：当某个新版本的处理方案在同一语料上同时降低了成本与质量，差额必须被显式记录成&quot;用 X% 质量换 Y% 成本&quot;这样一句话，而不是让数字悄悄漂移。这句话加上连续基线，才是让本 hub 前十一篇的取舍从直觉变成工程纪律的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四类成本（处理/存储/分发/质量）量纲不同，必须分别度量再合成；它们是权衡关系而非加和关系。</li>\n<li>三个单位成本定义式（单资产处理成本、单请求分发成本、单位像素质量效率）是跨时间、跨业务可比较的基础。</li>\n<li>四组信号缺一不可；重试率是先行指标；存储要按前缀分布看（未完成分片是隐性成本）；命中率必须按内容类别分桶；质量基线必须连续而非一次性。</li>\n<li>质量回退门要求&quot;同一资产上多版本并存&quot;，这直接依赖内容寻址键；比较时用 P05 而非最小值。</li>\n<li>报表按决策问题（资产类型 / 终端档位 / 管道版本）切分，而非按数据来源切分；每次权衡都要被写成一句可审计的话。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此本 hub 的四条线闭环：图片与视频定义了&quot;产出什么&quot;（<a href=\"../image-transform/\">1 图片处理</a>、<a href=\"../video-transcode/\">2 视频处理</a>），任务编排保证了&quot;可靠产出&quot;（<a href=\"../processing-pipeline/\">3 处理任务编排</a>），分发与运营保证了&quot;正确且经济地送达&quot;，而本篇让这一切取舍变得可测量、可回归。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"媒体成本与质量指标监控","id":"媒体成本与质量指标监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单位成本的三个定义式","id":"单位成本的三个定义式"},{"level":3,"text":"单资产处理成本","id":"单资产处理成本"},{"level":3,"text":"单请求分发成本","id":"单请求分发成本"},{"level":3,"text":"单位像素质量效率","id":"单位像素质量效率"},{"level":2,"text":"必须采集的四组信号","id":"必须采集的四组信号"},{"level":3,"text":"处理组：重试率是先行指标","id":"处理组-重试率是先行指标"},{"level":3,"text":"存储组：按前缀分布是成本归因的载体","id":"存储组-按前缀分布是成本归因的载体"},{"level":3,"text":"分发组：命中率必须按内容类别分开看","id":"分发组-命中率必须按内容类别分开看"},{"level":3,"text":"质量组：基线必须连续，而不是一次性","id":"质量组-基线必须连续-而不是一次性"},{"level":2,"text":"质量回退门与参数变更流程","id":"质量回退门与参数变更流程"},{"level":3,"text":"失败样本必须被留档","id":"失败样本必须被留档"},{"level":2,"text":"报表的组织方式","id":"报表的组织方式"},{"level":3,"text":"三张切片","id":"三张切片"},{"level":3,"text":"底表的四列","id":"底表的四列"},{"level":3,"text":"把权衡写成一句话","id":"把权衡写成一句话"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多端响应式分发（srcset/Accept）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/media-asset-processing-service/cdn-delivery-ops/responsive-srcset-serving"},"next":null}